text: ['({C} represents colorless mana.)\\nAt the beginning of combat on your turn, reveal the top card of your library. If a creature card is revealed this way, you may have creatures you control other than Deceiver of Form become copies of that card until end of turn. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.', '({C} represents colorless mana.)\\nChoose one —\\n• Exile target creature with power or toughness 1 or less.\\n• Counter target sorcery spell.\\n• Create a 1/1 colorless Eldrazi Scion creature token. It has "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', '({C} represents colorless mana.)\\nTarget creature gets +3/-3 until end of turn.', '({C} represents colorless mana.)\\nTrample, haste\\nWhenever Reality Smasher becomes the target of a spell an opponent controls, counter that spell unless its controller discards a card.', '({C} represents colorless mana.)\\nTrample\\nWalker of the Wastes gets +1/+1 for each land you control named Wastes.', "({C} represents colorless mana.)\\nWhen Matter Reshaper dies, reveal the top card of your library. You may put that card onto the battlefield if it's a permanent card with mana value 3 or less. Otherwise, put that card into your hand.", '({C} represents colorless mana.)\\nWhen Thought-Knot Seer enters the battlefield, target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a nonland card from it and exile that card.\\nWhen Thought-Knot Seer leaves the battlefield, target opponent draws a card.', "As an additional cost to cast this spell, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\nDevour in Flames deals 5 damage to target creature or planeswalker.", 'Baloth Pup has trample as long as it has a +1/+1 counter on it.', 'Cinder Barrens enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {R}.', 'Cohort — {T}, Tap an untapped Ally you control: Create a tapped 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', 'Cohort — {T}, Tap an untapped Ally you control: Discard a card. If you do, draw a card.', 'Cohort — {T}, Tap an untapped Ally you control: Look at the top four cards of your library. You may reveal an Equipment card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'Cohort — {T}, Tap an untapped Ally you control: Put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control.', 'Cohort — {T}, Tap an untapped Ally you control: Tap target creature.', 'Cohort — {T}, Tap an untapped Ally you control: Target opponent loses 2 life.', 'Cohort — {T}, Tap an untapped Ally you control: You draw a card and you lose 1 life.', 'Cohort — {T}, Tap an untapped Ally you control: You gain 2 life.', 'Counter target noncreature spell.', 'Create two 2/2 white Knight Ally creature tokens.', 'Creatures you control get +1/+0 and gain indestructible until end of turn. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy them.)', 'Crumbling Vestige enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Crumbling Vestige enters the battlefield, add one mana of any color.\\n{T}: Add {C}. ({C} represents colorless mana.)', "Deathtouch\\n{1}, Sacrifice another creature: You gain life equal to the sacrificed creature's toughness.\\n{1}{W}{B}, Sacrifice another creature: Exile target nonland permanent. Activate only if you have at least 10 life more than your starting life total.", "Defender\\nWhen Wall of Resurgence enters the battlefield, you may put three +1/+1 counters on target land you control. If you do, that land becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste that's still a land.", 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment with mana value 3 or less.', 'Destroy target attacking creature.', 'Destroy target attacking or blocking creature with power 2 or less.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nAll creatures get -2/-2 until end of turn. If a creature would die this turn, exile it instead.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you lose 1 life unless you control another colorless creature.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nChoose one —\\n• Exile target land creature.\\n• Consuming Sinkhole deals 4 damage to target player or planeswalker.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nCounter target spell unless its controller pays {1}. You create a 1/1 colorless Eldrazi Scion creature token. It has "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}." ({C} represents colorless mana.)', "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nCounter target spell. If that spell is countered this way, exile it instead of putting it into its owner's graveyard.", 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nEldrazi Aggressor has haste as long as you control another colorless creature.', "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nEnchant creature\\nEnchanted creature can't block.\\nWhenever enchanted creature deals damage, its controller loses that much life.", 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nExile target creature.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nFirst strike\\nWhenever another colorless creature enters the battlefield under your control, target opponent loses 1 life.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nFlash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\\nWhen Void Grafter enters the battlefield, another target creature you control gains hexproof until end of turn.', "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nFlash\\nFlying\\n{1}{C}: Target opponent exiles the top card of their library. If it's a land card, you may return Dimensional Infiltrator to its owner's hand. ({C} represents colorless mana.)", 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nFlash\\nWhen you cast this spell, you may pay {C}. If you do, create a 1/1 colorless Eldrazi Scion creature token for each nontoken creature that died under your control this turn. Those tokens have "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nFlying\\nWhen Inverter of Truth enters the battlefield, exile all cards from your library face down, then shuffle all cards from your graveyard into your library.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nFlying\\nWhenever Gravity Negator attacks, you may pay {C}. If you do, another target creature gains flying until end of turn. ({C} represents colorless mana.)', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nFlying\\nWhenever you cast a colorless spell, Sky Scourer gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nFlying\\nWhenever you cast a colorless spell, target opponent exiles the top card of their library.', "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nKozilek's Return deals 2 damage to each creature.\\nWhenever you cast an Eldrazi creature spell with mana value 7 or greater, you may exile Kozilek's Return from your graveyard. If you do, Kozilek's Return deals 5 damage to each creature.", "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nMindmelter can't be blocked.\\n{3}{C}: Target opponent exiles a card from their hand. Activate only as a sorcery. ({C} represents colorless mana.)", 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nPay 1 life: Add {C}. Activate only once each turn. ({C} represents colorless mana.)', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nReality Hemorrhage deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nSearch your library for a basic land card and reveal it. You may put that card onto the battlefield tapped if you control a land named Wastes. Otherwise, put that card into your hand. Then shuffle.', "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nTarget creature can't be blocked this turn.\\nDraw a card.", 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nTarget creature gets +2/+0 until end of turn. Regenerate it.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nTarget opponent exiles two cards from their hand and loses 2 life.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nWhen Birthing Hulk enters the battlefield, create two 1/1 colorless Eldrazi Scion creature tokens. They have "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}." ({C} represents colorless mana.)\\n{1}{C}: Regenerate Birthing Hulk.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nWhen Scion Summoner enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 colorless Eldrazi Scion creature token. It has "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}." ({C} represents colorless mana.)', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nWhen you cast this spell, exile target artifact, enchantment, or land.\\nReach\\n{2}{C}, Sacrifice a land: Return World Breaker from your graveyard to your hand. ({C} represents colorless mana.)', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nWhen you cast this spell, you may pay {1}{C}. If you do, gain control of target creature until end of turn, untap that creature, and it gains haste until end of turn. ({C} represents colorless mana.)\\nHaste', "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nWhen you cast this spell, you may pay {1}{C}. If you do, target opponent sacrifices a creature. ({C} represents colorless mana.)\\nFlying\\nBearer of Silence can't block.", "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nWhenever a creature you control deals combat damage to a player, you may draw a card.\\n{3}{C}: Target creature can't be blocked this turn. ({C} represents colorless mana.)", 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nWhenever another nontoken creature you control dies, create a 1/1 colorless Eldrazi Scion creature token. It has "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}." ({C} represents colorless mana.)', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\n{1}{C}: Havoc Sower gets +2/+1 until end of turn. ({C} represents colorless mana.)', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\n{1}{C}: Target opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life. ({C} represents colorless mana.)', "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\n{2}{C}: Each creature with toughness greater than its power can't block this turn. ({C} represents colorless mana.)", "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\n{2}{C}: Exile another target creature, then return it to the battlefield tapped under its owner's control. ({C} represents colorless mana.)", "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\n{3}{C}, Exile a creature card from your graveyard: Target opponent loses life equal to the exiled card's power. ({C} represents colorless mana.)", 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\n{3}{C}: Draw a card. ({C} represents colorless mana.)', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\n{C}, {T}: Tap target creature. ({C} represents colorless mana.)', "Devoid (This card has no color.)\\n{C}: Kozilek's Shrieker gets +1/+0 and gains menace until end of turn. (It can't be blocked except by two or more creatures. {C} represents colorless mana.)", 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\n{C}: Maw of Kozilek gets +2/-2 until end of turn. ({C} represents colorless mana.)', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\n{C}: Slaughter Drone gains deathtouch until end of turn. (Any amount of damage it deals to a creature is enough to destroy it. {C} represents colorless mana.)', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\n{C}: Stalking Drone gets +1/+2 until end of turn. Activate only once each turn. ({C} represents colorless mana.)', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\n{T}: Add {C}. Spend this mana only to cast a colorless spell, activate an ability of a colorless permanent, or pay a cost that contains {C}. ({C} represents colorless mana.)', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+1 and has menace. (It can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2, has vigilance, and can block an additional creature each combat.', 'Equipped creature gets +1/+0.\\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', "Equipped creature gets +1/+0.\\nWhenever equipped creature attacks, create a 1/1 white Kor Ally creature token that's tapped and attacking.\\nEquip {1}", 'Equipped creature gets +1/+1 and has haste.\\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', 'Equipped creature gets +1/+1 for each other creature you control that shares a creature type with it.\\nEquip {2}', "Equipped creature gets +2/+2 and has menace. (It can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)\\nEquip {3}", 'Equipped creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nWhenever an equipped creature you control dies, draw a card.', "First strike\\nCohort — {T}, Tap an untapped Ally you control: Zada's Commando deals 1 damage to target opponent or planeswalker.", 'Flying', 'Flying, haste\\nProwess (Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, this creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)', 'Flying, vigilance\\n{1}{W}: Target creature with a +1/+1 counter on it gains flying and vigilance until end of turn.', "Flying\\nWhen Cyclone Sire dies, you may put three +1/+1 counters on target land you control. If you do, that land becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste that's still a land.", 'Flying\\nWhen Expedition Raptor enters the battlefield, support 2. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two other target creatures.)', 'Flying\\nWhen Linvala, the Preserver enters the battlefield, if an opponent has more life than you, you gain 5 life.\\nWhen Linvala enters the battlefield, if an opponent controls more creatures than you, create a 3/3 white Angel creature token with flying.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Vampire Envoy becomes tapped, you gain 1 life.', 'Flying\\nWhenever you gain life, each opponent loses 1 life.', 'Hexproof\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may reveal your hand. If you do, you win the game if you own a card named Hedron Alignment in exile, in your hand, in your graveyard, and on the battlefield.\\n{1}{U}: Scry 1.', "Hissing Quagmire enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {G}.\\n{1}{B}{G}: Hissing Quagmire becomes a 2/2 black and green Elemental creature with deathtouch until end of turn. It's still a land.", "Kor Scythemaster has first strike as long as it's attacking.", 'Lifelink\\nIf a nontoken creature an opponent controls would die, instead exile that card and create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.\\n{2}{B}, Sacrifice another Vampire or Zombie: Put two +1/+1 counters on Kalitas, Traitor of Ghet.', 'Meandering River enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {U}.', 'Menace\\nWhen Goblin Dark-Dwellers enters the battlefield, you may cast target instant or sorcery card with mana value 3 or less from your graveyard without paying its mana cost. If that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead.', 'Mill three cards, then you may return a creature card from your graveyard to your hand. (To mill three cards, put the top three cards of your library into your graveyard.)', "Mirrorpool enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}{C}, {T}, Sacrifice Mirrorpool: Copy target instant or sorcery spell you control. You may choose new targets for the copy.\\n{4}{C}, {T}, Sacrifice Mirrorpool: Create a token that's a copy of target creature you control.", "Needle Spires enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {W}.\\n{2}{R}{W}: Needle Spires becomes a 2/1 red and white Elemental creature with double strike until end of turn. It's still a land.", 'Other creatures you control get +1/+0 as long as you control an Equipment.', 'Prowess (Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, this creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)\\nWhenever Netcaster Spider blocks a creature with flying, Netcaster Spider gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Reach\\nWhen Seed Guardian dies, create an X/X green Elemental creature token, where X is the number of creature cards in your graveyard.', "Return target creature or land card from a graveyard to its owner's hand. You gain 6 life.", "Return target creature to its owner's hand. If that creature is attacking, you may put it on top of its owner's library instead.", "Return up to two target creatures your opponents control to their owners' hands. Target player draws two cards.", 'Ruins of Oran-Rief enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {C}. ({C} represents colorless mana.)\\n{T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on target colorless creature that entered the battlefield this turn.', 'Search your library for a planeswalker card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', "Sparkmage's Gambit deals 1 damage to each of up to two target creatures. Those creatures can't block this turn.", 'Submerged Boneyard enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}.', 'Support 2. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two target creatures.)', 'Support 2. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two target creatures.)\\nChoose up to one target creature an opponent controls. Each creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it deals damage equal to its power to that creature.', 'Support 2. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two target creatures.)\\nDraw a card.', 'Support 2. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two target creatures.)\\nGain control of target creature until end of turn. Untap that creature. It gains haste until end of turn.', 'Support 2. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two target creatures.)\\nUntap each creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it.', 'Surge {1}{R} (You may cast this spell for its surge cost if you or a teammate has cast another spell this turn.)\\nBoulder Salvo deals 4 damage to target creature.', 'Surge {1}{R} (You may cast this spell for its surge cost if you or a teammate has cast another spell this turn.)\\nHaste\\nWhen Reckless Bushwhacker enters the battlefield, if its surge cost was paid, other creatures you control get +1/+0 and gain haste until end of turn.', "Surge {1}{R} (You may cast this spell for its surge cost if you or a teammate has cast another spell this turn.)\\nMenace (This creature can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)", "Surge {1}{U} (You may cast this spell for its surge cost if you or a teammate has cast another spell this turn.)\\nTap target creature. It doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.\\nDraw a card.", 'Surge {2}{U} (You may cast this spell for its surge cost if you or a teammate has cast another spell this turn.)\\nFlying', 'Surge {2}{U} (You may cast this spell for its surge cost if you or a teammate has cast another spell this turn.)\\nTarget player draws two cards.', 'Surge {3}{R}{R} (You may cast this spell for its surge cost if you or a teammate has cast another spell this turn.)\\nFlying\\nWhen Tyrant of Valakut enters the battlefield, if its surge cost was paid, it deals 3 damage to any target.', "Surge {3}{U}{U} (You may cast this spell for its surge cost if you or a teammate has cast another spell this turn.)\\nReturn all nonland permanents to their owners' hands. If this spell's surge cost was paid, create an 8/8 blue Octopus creature token.", "Surge {U} (You may cast this spell for its surge cost if you or a teammate has cast another spell this turn.)\\nEnchant creature\\nEnchanted creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.", "Surge {U}{U} (You may cast this spell for its surge cost if you or a teammate has cast another spell this turn.)\\nThis spell can't be countered.\\nCounter target spell.", 'Surge {X}{R} (You may cast this spell for its surge cost if you or a teammate has cast another spell this turn.)\\nFall of the Titans deals X damage to each of up to two targets.', 'Target creature gains haste until end of turn.\\nDraw a card.', 'Target creature gets +1/+2 and gains reach until end of turn. Untap it. (A creature with reach can block creatures with flying.)', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 and gains flying until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +3/+1 and gains trample until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets -3/-2 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets -4/-4 until end of turn.', "Target land you control becomes a 4/4 Elemental creature with haste until end of turn. It's still a land. It must be blocked this turn if able.", 'Target opponent loses 5 life unless that player discards two cards or sacrifices a creature or planeswalker. Repeat this process once.', "This spell can't be countered.\\nFlying, hexproof\\nInstant and sorcery spells you control can't be countered.", "This spell can't be countered.\\nTears of Valakut deals 5 damage to target creature with flying.", 'Timber Gorge enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {G}.', "Trample\\nLand creatures you control have trample.\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may have target land you control become a 3/3 Elemental creature with haste until end of turn. It's still a land.", 'Trample\\nWhen Cinder Hellion enters the battlefield, it deals 2 damage to target opponent or planeswalker.', 'Tranquil Expanse enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {W}.', "Untap Endbringer during each other player's untap step.\\n{T}: Endbringer deals 1 damage to any target.\\n{C}, {T}: Target creature can't attack or block this turn.\\n{C}{C}, {T}: Draw a card.", 'Until end of turn, target creature loses all abilities and becomes a green Elephant with base power and toughness 3/3.', 'Vigilance', 'Vigilance, trample', 'Vigilance\\nAs long as you control six or more lands, Sylvan Advocate and land creatures you control get +2/+2.', "Vigilance\\nLand creatures you control have vigilance.\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may have target land you control become a 3/3 Elemental creature with haste until end of turn. It's still a land.", 'Vigilance\\n{T}: Add {C}. ({C} represents colorless mana.)', 'Wandering Fumarole enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {R}.\\n{2}{U}{R}: Until end of turn, Wandering Fumarole becomes a 1/4 blue and red Elemental creature with "{0}: Switch this creature\'s power and toughness until end of turn." It\'s still a land.', 'When Baloth Null enters the battlefield, return up to two target creature cards from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Bonds of Mortality enters the battlefield, draw a card.\\n{G}: Creatures your opponents control lose hexproof and indestructible until end of turn.', 'When General Tazri enters the battlefield, you may search your library for an Ally creature card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}: Ally creatures you control get +X/+X until end of turn, where X is the number of colors among those creatures.', 'When Gladehart Cavalry enters the battlefield, support 6. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to six other target creatures.)\\nWhenever a creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it dies, you gain 2 life.', 'When Harvester Troll enters the battlefield, you may sacrifice a creature or land. If you do, put two +1/+1 counters on Harvester Troll.', "When Isolation Zone enters the battlefield, exile target creature or enchantment an opponent controls until Isolation Zone leaves the battlefield. (That permanent returns under its owner's control.)", 'When Loam Larva enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, then shuffle and put that card on top.', 'When Oath of Chandra enters the battlefield, it deals 3 damage to target creature an opponent controls.\\nAt the beginning of each end step, if a planeswalker entered the battlefield under your control this turn, Oath of Chandra deals 2 damage to each opponent.', 'When Oath of Gideon enters the battlefield, create two 1/1 white Kor Ally creature tokens.\\nEach planeswalker you control enters the battlefield with an additional loyalty counter on it.', 'When Oath of Jace enters the battlefield, draw three cards, then discard two cards.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, scry X, where X is the number of planeswalkers you control.', 'When Oath of Nissa enters the battlefield, look at the top three cards of your library. You may reveal a creature, land, or planeswalker card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.\\nYou may spend mana as though it were mana of any color to cast planeswalker spells.', "When Reflector Mage enters the battlefield, return target creature an opponent controls to its owner's hand. That creature's owner can't cast spells with the same name as that creature until your next turn.", 'When Relief Captain enters the battlefield, support 3. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to three other target creatures.)', 'When Saddleback Lagac enters the battlefield, support 2. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two other target creatures.)', 'When you cast this spell, if you have fewer than seven cards in hand, draw cards equal to the difference.\\nMenace\\nDiscard a card with mana value X: Counter target spell with mana value X.', "Whenever another colorless creature enters the battlefield under your control, you may change Eldrazi Mimic's base power and toughness to that creature's power and toughness until end of turn.", "Whenever you cast your second spell each turn, Pyromancer's Assault deals 2 damage to any target.", 'Whenever you cast your second spell each turn, draw a card.', 'Whenever you tap a land for mana, add one mana of any type that land produced. (The types of mana are white, blue, black, red, green, and colorless.)\\nWhenever you cast a creature spell, draw a card.', "You gain life equal to target creature's power. The next time that creature would deal damage this turn, prevent that damage.", "You may play an additional land on each of your turns.\\n{R}{G}, Return a land you control to its owner's hand: Target creature gains trample until end of turn.", '[+1]: Create a 0/1 green Plant creature token.\\n[−2]: Put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control.\\n[−7]: You gain X life and draw X cards, where X is the number of lands you control.', '[+1]: Create two 3/1 red Elemental creature tokens with haste. Exile them at the beginning of the next end step.\\n[0]: Discard all the cards in your hand, then draw that many cards plus one.\\n[−X]: Chandra, Flamecaller deals X damage to each creature.', "{0}: Attach target Equipment you control to Kazuul's Toll Collector. Activate only as a sorcery.", '{1}{R}{G}: Relentless Hunter gets +1/+1 and gains trample until end of turn.', '{1}{W}: Kor Sky Climber gains flying until end of turn.', '{3}{B}, Exile a creature card from your graveyard: Create a tapped 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', '{4}{G}{W}: Support 2. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two other target creatures.)', "{C}: Target creature can't block Kozilek's Pathfinder this turn. ({C} represents colorless mana.)", '{T}: Add {C}.', '{T}: Add {C}. ({C} represents colorless mana.)', '{T}: Add {C}. ({C} represents colorless mana.)\\n{2}{C}, {T}: Draw a card. Activate only if you have no cards in hand.', '{T}: Add {C}. ({C} represents colorless mana.)\\n{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color. Spend this mana only to cast a spell with devoid.', '{T}: Add {C}. ({C} represents colorless mana.)\\n{T}, Tap an untapped creature you control: Add one mana of any color.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.)']
flavor: ['"A good lagac will carry you through thick and thin. A bad one . . . well, it\'s a tasty dinner."\\n—Raff Slugeater, goblin shortcutter', '"A touch of lightning, and anyone can be taught to dance."\\n—Tobin, sparkmage', '"Before the battle, I heard them take an oath near the ruins of Sea Gate. I hope they inspire others to keep watch."', '"Do not let yourselves fall now. Zendikar is depending on us—on you!"', '"Drana commands me. I command my nulls. And so her bidding is done."', '"Eldrazi don\'t die easy. Sometimes they don\'t die at all."\\n—Yon Basrel, Oran-Rief survivalist', '"Eventually, everything returns to silence."\\n—Zarra, lullmage', '"Follow me. Step lightly. And resist the urge to kick them."', '"For justice and peace, I will keep watch."', '"For the life of every plane, I will keep watch."', '"For the sake of the Multiverse, I will keep watch."', '"For those without the Planeswalker spark, the merest touch of the Blind Eternities can kill."\\n—Ugin', '"Humans use pigs to hunt for mushrooms, don\'t they? It\'s like that."\\n—Harak, Malakir bloodwitch', '"I have suffered a thousand lifetimes of agony on this wretched world. I\'ve far less time to share with you, but I assure you, no less pain."\\n—Ob Nixilis', '"I never thought I\'d miss the gomazoa."\\n—Trinda, Hada spy patrol', '"I run, and thunder follows."', '"I swore to take one head for each member of my family they killed. My task is nowhere near its end."', '"I welcome the use of even the foulest magic if it will rid us of the monstrosities that plague our world."\\n—Munda, ambush leader', '"I will follow the light of Iona into battle, and I will know no fear."', '"I\'ve heard it said that a Planeswalker is someone who can always run from danger. But Gideon\'s right: we\'re also the ones who can choose to stay."\\n—Jace Beleren', '"If it means that people can live in freedom, yeah, I\'ll keep watch."', '"If someone claims the sky is falling, I listen."\\n—Yon Basrel, Oran-Rief survivalist', '"If we\'re going to survive, we have to use every tool at our disposal. Especially the disgusting ones."\\n—Ryza, Oran-Rief scout', '"It\'s endearing, in a mystical, pointy sort of way."\\n—General Tazri, allied commander', '"Killing the Eldrazi is not enough. We must erase all memory of them from this world."\\n—Greenweaver Mina', '"Light can lay bare our fears. It can also make them go away."\\n—Nazra of the Stone Havens', '"Little flower twirl and bloom, arise from this your rocky tomb. Little warrior slash and brawl, be born again to free us all."', '"Long after the land has given up the last of its secrets, there will still be mysteries in the depths of the sea."\\n—Kiora', '"Look, and see the future."\\n—Ayli, high priest of the Eternal Pilgrims', '"Mindlessness is not weakness. When we are lost to hunger we are unstoppable."\\n—Drana, Kalastria bloodchief', '"My heart and Zendikar\'s beat as one. Together we will endure."\\n—Nissa Revane', '"My people are no longer slaves to the Eldrazi, beholden to the past. We will determine our own future."', '"My people blazed these pathways long ago, before the Eldrazi came. We will ride them long after the Eldrazi are gone."', '"Our formation was scattered after Sea Gate fell. If you\'re fighting the Eldrazi, consider us your newest recruits."', '"Our time grows short. If we wish to vanquish the Eldrazi, we must unlock the hedrons\' secrets."\\n—Jace Beleren', '"Sea Gate is gone, the Halimar basin empty. But rebuild the seawall and give these waters time, and they will fill the basin anew."', '"Sea Gate may have fallen, but we still stand. We still fight."\\n—Gideon Jura', '"Some relic hunters have given up exploring and gone to fight the Eldrazi. But I know our work is more important than ever. The secrets we uncover could lead to the world\'s salvation."', '"Sometimes being fast is as important as being smart."\\n—Ryza, Oran-Rief scout', '"The Eldrazi are nothing if not thorough."\\n—Jace Beleren', '"The Eldrazi have surprised us before. It\'s my job to make sure that never happens again."', '"The Eldrazi make worse than ruins—they make a world where not even ruins stand."\\n—Gideon Jura', '"The Roil may be unpredictable, but it is not uncontrollable."\\n—Noyan Dar, Tazeem roilmage', '"The distraction of your life has ended. Now your service begins."\\n—Kalitas, thrall of Ulamog', '"The land gives of itself. Its abundance provides, even in times of chaos."', '"The light of a felidar\'s horns can give even an Eldrazi pause."\\n—Zarra, lullmage', '"The most elegant solutions are found in nature. You just have to know where to look."', '"The stone speaks. We are merely interpreters."', '"The sun can warm your skin or blister it, nurture your crops or wither them, light your path or blind you. She is a fickle friend, but a far worse enemy."\\n—Nazra of the Stone Havens', '"There\'s a word for someone who brings too much gear to battle: \'survivor.\'"\\n—Zada of Slab Haven', '"They employ a foul sort of teamwork."\\n—General Tazri, allied commander', '"Through all the terrors we face, I hold on to the memory of the world before the Eldrazi came. I\'d like to see that world again."', '"Ulamog stood before us at Sea Gate, ready to succumb . . . and then Kozilek arose. Whatever hope I had for our world died."\\n—Vandri, Kalastria emissary', '"Walk now in my light. When the rest of the world closes its eyes, you will still see."\\n—Iona', '"We didn\'t know where it came from or where it was going. All we knew was that we did not matter."\\n—Akiri, kor line-slinger', '"We may have lost faith in our gods, but we are far from losing faith in ourselves."\\n—Munda, ambush leader', '"What will not yield will be consumed."\\n—Ayli, high priest of the Eternal Pilgrims', '"When I\'m done training you, anything will be a deadly weapon."', '"With rope, I can fly as far as the rope can reach. But with light, the sky is the limit."', '"Your blood whispers secrets your mind could never comprehend."', '"Zendikar will fight until it has bled its last."', '"Zendikar\'s true gods have risen. Whether in reverence or agony, all the world will kneel."\\n—Ayli, high priest of the Eternal Pilgrims', 'A light to bring hope in dark times.', 'A mudflow swallowed the lowlands years ago. All that remains are a bottomless mire and an endless rain of ash.', 'A void as cryptic as reality itself.', 'A young baloth channels its energy into playful destructiveness. Over time, it becomes less playful but no less destructive.', 'After the fall of Sea Gate and the draining of the Halimar basin, the crab set off to find a new home.', 'As Gideon kept the brood lineages at bay, Chandra incinerated the bound Eldrazi titans.', 'As easy to stop as it is to comprehend.', 'As the Eldrazi adapted to the jungles of Zendikar, some took on the tactics of more familiar predators.', 'Chandra used jets of flame to lure hellions into the path of oncoming Eldrazi.', 'Despite the chaos of the Roil and the devastation of the Eldrazi, Zendikar is a world of breathtaking beauty.', 'Eldrazi break concentration like glass.', 'Even in areas of profound devastation, the hedrons remained intact.', 'Faced with the novel problem of inspiring an army, Jace asked himself: "What would Gideon say?"', 'For a moment they stood tall, all fear forgotten.', 'Forged for victory in a time of despair.', 'From nothingness, sustenance.', 'Gideon and Nissa carved a path through the Eldrazi swarm, and their Zendikari allies charged into the fray behind them.', 'Greenweaver Mina and her twin brother Denn lead the last of the Mul Daya into an uncertain future.', 'Having no interest in the greater conflict, the trolls continue to prey upon whatever wanders into their domain.', 'He answers questions as readily as he asks them, but his answer is always "no."', 'In its shadow, everything changed.', 'In the absence of life, something yet grows.', 'In the face of extinction, the most perilous endeavors can be cause for hope.', 'In the jungles of Tazeem, aerial assault is not always advantageous.', 'It denied the Zendikari the chance to stand and die fighting.', "It doesn't twist words. It twists worlds.", 'It glides over the landscape. It also happens to be one.', 'It grew with a terrible swiftness.', 'It is a reminder that spring will always follow winter.', 'It is consistently inconsistent.', 'It kills what is, making way for what should not be.', 'It left behind an echoing emptiness more horrible than the grave.', "It's an experience you'll never forget.", "It's bad enough to be torn to pieces. It's worse by far to be torn from the world itself.", "It's not the size of the rock. It's how badly you want to lift it.", 'Jace discovered the leyline pattern needed to anchor Ulamog and Kozilek to reality, but it was Nissa who could trace it on her world.', "Kozilek's brood infiltrates and deceives. The spawn of Ulamog mindlessly consume.", "Kozilek's presence warped the land, stripping away layer after layer.", 'Listen to the sound of defeat.', "Never ask a pyromancer if that's the best she's got.", 'Ob Nixilis had prepared for every eventuality—except Chandra Nalaar.', 'Once a center for knowledge, Sea Gate now serves as a reminder of what was lost.', 'Once a simple tool, it—like everything else on Zendikar—has been turned into a weapon against the Eldrazi.', 'Only one Eldrazi stood against them, yet the defenders were outnumbered.', "Roilmages' tactics are as chaotic as the energies they channel.", 'Sometimes gestures of support are small. Sometimes not.', 'Tarek could not tell whether he was losing his blood or his mind.', "Tazeem's embrace is harsh, but for those that call it home, nothing else will do.", 'The Eldrazi twisted in a direction that had no name, and a frontal assault became a panicked rout.', 'The Roil takes many forms. It also takes many victims.', 'The amorphous, magically animated residue known as the Fathom Sludge lurks in the Hagra Cistern, attacking its prey with pseudopods and dragging it down to be digested.', 'The chains obey her. Everything else would do best to get out of her way.', 'The forest floor of Murasa is home to life as diverse and vibrant as that of the canopy above.', 'The kor of Zendikar are known for quiet determination in the face of overwhelming odds.', 'The makers and menders are the first called to battle and the last to leave.', 'The nomadic kor carry only necessities on their long treks. The coming of the Eldrazi redefined "necessities."', 'The rampaging Roil creates life out of the most volatile elements.', 'The river split into many channels as it flowed to the Halimar Sea. Few travelers could follow the same one twice.', "The settlement's defenders were glad to have such a massive, ferocious creature join the fight—but less glad to see it flatten their homes along the way.", "The wastelands disorient even the most experienced scouts, making them easy prey for Kozilek's drones.", 'There are old goblins and ambitious goblins, but very few old, ambitious goblins.', 'Though solitary by nature, the sphinxes did not hesitate to join in the fight against the Eldrazi.', 'Travelers are advised to bring extra swords, preferably shiny ones.', 'When Kozilek destroyed Sea Gate, distant Valakut could not contain its grief.', 'When Kozilek emerged at Sea Gate, his brood lineage swarmed to the surface.', 'When properly aligned, hedrons become powerful tools of binding.', "Zendikar's defenders include both healers and vampires. One way or another, the fallen will return to the fight."]
artist: ['Alejandro Mirabal', 'Aleksi Briclot', 'Anastasia Ovchinnikova', 'Anthony Palumbo', 'Ben Maier', 'Chase Stone', 'Chris Rahn', 'Chris Rallis', 'Cliff Childs', 'Clint Cearley', 'Craig J Spearing', 'Cynthia Sheppard', 'Daarken', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Daniel Ljunggren', 'Darek Zabrocki', 'David Gaillet', 'David Palumbo', 'Deruchenko Alexander', 'Florian de Gesincourt', 'Greg Opalinski', 'Greg Staples', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Izzy', 'Jack Wang', 'Jaime Jones', 'Jakub Kasper', 'Jama Jurabaev', 'James Ryman', 'James Zapata', 'Jason Felix', 'Jason Kang', 'Jason Rainville', 'Johann Bodin', 'Johannes Voss', 'John Severin Brassell', 'Jonas De Ro', 'Joseph Meehan', 'Jung Park', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Kev Walker', 'Kieran Yanner', 'Lake Hurwitz', 'Lius Lasahido', 'Magali Villeneuve', 'Marco Nelor', 'Mathias Kollros', 'Matt Stewart', 'Noah Bradley', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Ryan Barger', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Slawomir Maniak', 'Steve Prescott', 'Steven Belledin', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Todd Lockwood', 'Tyler Jacobson', 'Victor Adame Minguez', 'Viktor Titov', 'Vincent Proce', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Wesley Burt', 'Willian Murai', 'Winona Nelson', 'Yefim Kligerman', 'Zack Stella', 'Zoltan Boros']
